WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.957
Watch and read: Ama asks: In “Ama reads.” which word is the action word?

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:09.047
The answer is: reads. A verb expresses an action.

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:14.155
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which spelling is correct for the common word “said”?

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.620
The answer is: said. Some words do not sound exactly as their spelling suggests.
